OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after HGV lorry hits
OL,4,Astationary car
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old man has died after his
OL,7,Fstationary car was struck by a lorry
OL,8,Fwhile at the side of a road.
OL,10,FWiltshire Police said the two-vehicle
OL,11,Fcrash occurred along the A303 westbound
OL,12,Fbetween Deptford and Chicklade, shortly
OL,13,Fafter 15:00 GMT on Monday.
OL,15,FTwo passengers in the car, a
OL,16,F53-year-old man and a 54-year-old
OL,17,Fwoman, were taken to hospital with
OL,18,Fnon-life threatening injuries. The
OL,19,Fdriver of the HGV was unharmed.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
